{
  "$schema": "Authored lesson groups for course.zh.json (Phase 12). Reviewable data, hand-edited like topics.json.",
  "$notes": [
    "Each group names one sitting: a run of words that must be taught together because they are",
    "one idea. Counting is the motivating case — 零一二三…十 split across two lessons is not",
    "counting. Everything unlisted falls into mechanical LESSON_WORDS-sized chunks with no name.",
    "",
    "Keyed by word (simp), never by unit id: unit ids move whenever the course is re-cut.",
    "A group applies only when ALL of its words land in the same unit; a straddling group is",
    "reported in report.txt and its words chunk mechanically, so this file can never lose a word.",
    "A group may run a little past LESSON_WORDS (counting is 11) but not far past it."
  ],
